      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, I'm a bit confused by the tunnel analogy. I'm trying to write a formal thesis for a sociology department, so I need to stick to strict statistical terminology. Could you please steer away from the metaphors and give me a more technical explanation of how the confidence interval relates to the null hypothesis, specifically regarding whether it supports the statistical significance indicated by the p-value?",
